## The elevator, the sphere room and the spinning barrel.

## Room 33. LOOK.BAS 3300 and 3350.

create the Elevator
  a room
  room name:
    Elevator

  You are in an elevator.

## Room 34. LOOK.BAS 3400 and 3450.

create the Sphere Room
  a room
  room name:
    Sphere room
  exits, one-way: north to the Maze 61, east to the Barrel Enterance, west to the Mountain Passage, south to the Elevator, in to the Gate
  down is blocked: cannot-reach-hole

  passage to the Barrel Enterance
    grammar
      barrier
  end passage

  This room has the shape of a giant sphere, with holes in all of the{br}
  major directions.

## Room 35. LOOK.BAS 3500 and 3550.

create the Barrel Enterance
  a room
  room name:
    Enterance to empty barrel
  exits, one-way: east to the Empty Barrel, west to the Sphere Room, down to the Empty Barrel

  passage to the Empty Barrel
    grammar
      door
  end passage

  You are in a room to the west of an empty barrel-shaped room.

## Room 36. LOOK.BAS 3600 and 3650.

create the Empty Barrel
  a room
  room name:
    Empty barrel
  exits, one-way: north to the Barrel Exit, down to the Empty Barrel
  east is blocked: barrel-spins

  passage to the Empty Barrel
    grammar
      door
  end passage

  You are in a large empty barrel.

## Room 37. LOOK.BAS 3700 and 3750.

create the Barrel Exit
  a room
  room name:
    Exit from empty barrel
  exits, one-way: northwest to the East End of Cylindrical Room, out to the East End of Cylindrical Room
  west is blocked: barrel-spins
  in is blocked: barrel-spins

  passage to the Barrel Exit
    grammar
      barrier
    blocked: barrel-spins
  end passage

  You are east of the empty barrel.A passage goes NW.

## Room 38. LOOK.BAS 3800 and 3850.

create the Recording Studio
  a room
  room name:
    Recording studio
  exits, one-way: south to the East End of Cylindrical Room, out to the East End of Cylindrical Room

  This is a former recording studio for Gnome Records L.T.D.

## Room 39. LOOK.BAS 3900 and 3950.

create the East End of Cylindrical Room
  a room
  room name:
    E. end of cylindrical room
  exits, one-way: north to the Recording Studio, east to the Barrel Exit, west to the West End of Cylindrical Room

  You are at the east end of a long,cylindrical room{br}
  with a passage to the north. Written here is{br}
  "GET ME OUT OF HERE!!!"

## Room 40. LOOK.BAS 4000 and 4050.

create the West End of Cylindrical Room
  a room
  room name:
    W. end of cylindrical room
  exits, one-way: east to the East End of Cylindrical Room
  up is blocked: cannot-reach-hole

  passage to the Sphere Room
    grammar
      barrier
  end passage

  You are at the west end of the cylindrical room,{br}
  with a hole on the ceiling. There is an empty barrel fastened{br}
  to the floor.

## Room 77. LOOK.BAS 7700 and 7750.

create the Dark Room
  a room
  room name:
    Dark room
  exits, one-way: down to the West End of Cylindrical Room

  You are in an extremely dark room, filled with black gas{br}
  which obscures your vision. There is a hole going down>
